        },
        {
          "type": "pan",
          "grid": [
            16,
            10
          ],
          "native_source": "0x34958"
        },
        {
          "type": "native_acting",
          "native_event_id": 25,
          "native_acting": {
            "resource": 30,
            "source": "0x34962"
          }
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speaker": 12,
          "text": "哎呀!一大群男人追殺一個小姑娘,不覺得丟臉嗎?",
          "native_source": "0x34989",
          "native_text_index": 2
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speaker": -1,
          "text": "妳的一拳讓我的部下得療養三個月,無故毆打王國駐軍可是重罪,乖乖的跟我回去說個明白吧!",
          "native_source": "0x34989",
          "native_text_index": 2
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speaker": 12,
          "text": "誰教他對我亂瞄!你們王國軍都是這個樣子的嗎?",
          "native_source": "0x34989",
          "native_text_index": 2
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speaker": -1,
          "text": "哼....不和妳吵了,給我抓起來!",
          "native_source": "0x34989",
          "native_text_index": 2
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speaker": 1,
          "text": "咦!那邊有王國軍在圍攻一個小女孩,這是怎麼一回事?",
          "native_source": "0x34989",
          "native_text_index": 2
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speaker": 13,
          "text": "喂,我們自己都顧不了了,不要再去湊熱鬧...",
          "native_source": "0x34989",
          "native_text_index": 2
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speaker": 0,
          "text": "什麼!你能眼睜睜的看著一群王國軍欺負一個小女孩?我自己去收拾他們好了。",
          "native_source": "0x34989",
          "native_text_index": 2
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speaker": 4,
          "text": "好啦好啦,我陪你去就是了,反正不差這幾個...",
          "native_source": "0x34989",
          "native_text_index": 2
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speaker": 13,
          "text": "好吧,那就上吧!",
          "native_source": "0x34989",
          "native_text_index": 2
        },
        {
          "type": "set_native_event_state",
          "native_event_id": 25,
          "event_state_index": 17,
          "event_state_value": 1,
          "native_source": "0x34996"
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
